    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a pretty strong critique. You mentioned that these conservative arguments can be \"seen as outdated and illogical.\" Do you mean that from a purely logical standpoint they fail, or are you saying that their philosophical foundations are just no longer compatible with modern ethics?",
